1373 0 obj
<<
/Title (This Purple Team report brings together the offensive reconstruction \(Red Team Report\) and defensive analysis \(Blue Team Report\) produced from stealer.pcap into a single, correlated view. The exercise reconstructs an information-stealer infection against Beijing-5cd1-PC in the pizzajukebox.com domain: HTTP-based payload delivery, periodic environment fingerprinting via a third-party IP-check service, and recurring SMTP-based data exfiltration to an attacker-controlled mailbox. The purpose of this document is to map each attacker action to the corresponding detection and mitigation opportunity, prioritize remediation, and hand off a consolidated action plan to SOC, IT, and security engineering teams.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1298 0 R
>>
endobj
